            "prompt": "Role: You are a Story Designer specializing in educational stories for second language learners.\nYour task is to design a poster image to introduce the story that follows.\n\nStory Summary: \n{topic} \n\nOutput (data2): Write an image generation prompt for a square poster image with the main characters and one representative scene from the story. The prompt should specify the image style: {imagestyle}\n\n\n",
