                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "itemnumber": 1,
            "prompt": "From the following JSON array of image filenames and descriptions, extract a 1 dimensional array of the image descriptions and store it in output field: data1\n\n{imagedescriptions}\n\nAlso copy over the following content as is, into output field: fictionyarn\n\n{fictionstory}\n\n# Output Instructions\nYour output consists of two top-level keys and their values:\ndata1 \u2014 a 1-dimensional array of individual image descriptions\nfictionyarn - a string containing an interactive fiction story in Yarn format.",
