    "lessonTitle": "Add Pics to Interactive Story",
    "lessonDescription": "The purpose of this template is to augment a fiction item story, by generating pictures from the supplied image prompts. This template takes as input:  story summary, an image generation style, a story in yarn format with image placeholders, and a json array with image names (that match the placeholders) + image generation prompts. It produces 2 items, a content page item with a picture, and a fiction item with images matching all the placeholders. ",
